@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+# dasCowork Runtime allowlist
+
+The v0.8.0 upstream snapshot is a source input, not a blanket runtime payload.
+The builder copies only the patched skill instructions and the generation/QA
+files named in the Runtime bundle manifest. It excludes all network clients,
+OpenAI-key readers, installer/bootstrap code, web crawlers, existing-PPTX
+editing workflows, and React/sharp icon rendering.
+
+## Allowed product operation
+
+1. Generate a new PPTX from non-PPTX workspace inputs.
+2. Run offline structural and render QA with Runtime-owned dependencies.
+3. Return the new artifact and preview it in the workspace.
+
+## Required execution boundary
+
+- `load_workspace_dependencies` is the only dependency-discovery interface.
+- Runtime scripts execute with the ordinary app-server command facility.
+- Model and image generation stay in the application-host handoff; the Runtime
+  receives only supplied image files and never a credential or network target.
+- Missing Runtime paths are terminal for this operation; no host fallback or
+  online install is permitted.
+
+## Disallowed source areas
+
+- `generate_openai_image.py`, `fetch_wikimedia_cc.py`, and other network code.
+- setup, bootstrap, virtual-environment, npm, and pip installers.
+- Existing PPTX inspection, editing, redesign, or round-trip workflows.
+- React-icon slugs and the React/sharp icon renderer.
